    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon receiving visions of doomsday fast approaching, Meridian is left with one mission before time runs out: to reverse the world\u2019s fate by summoning love through the forbidden art of divine matchmaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled in an arcana of her own, Meridian\u2019s answer lies in the heart of the mystical Lapis cards, as she consults the cosmos to inspire new love connections across the city, which has been overtaken by astral gods peddling their own twisted notions of love to their believers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the astrals\u2019 targets set on her, Meridian must ensure that those who believe in her magic will be guaranteed an everlasting love, no matter the otherworldly obstacles awaiting. For as she sees it, a true love as foretold by the stars is simply the only way to stop the doomsday clock... and the key to a most amorous salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/a55a783b9fd879eda0c76096bd3d4188.avif?t=1753976991\" width=680 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Meridian</strong>, leading your followers to save the world from doomsday with the power of love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/16ce4bf10cd9b2a99dfbff03e951e249.avif?t=1753976991\" data-has-big width=800 height=509 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Cult Members </strong>in the love pairing mini-game. You can customize their skin tone, hair style, and clothes and watch your customized cult members date NPCs to bring love to the city to stop doomsday's approach.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7dc1570e5c74b06812fcacffae5e863e.poster.avif?t=1753976991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7dc1570e5c74b06812fcacffae5e863e.webm?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7dc1570e5c74b06812fcacffae5e863e.mp4?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/5d3459025081d0f70ed76079dd7fe7a2.poster.avif?t=1753976991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/5d3459025081d0f70ed76079dd7fe7a2.webm?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/5d3459025081d0f70ed76079dd7fe7a2.mp4?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a different common route each time you play </strong>with the Lapis Arcana illuminating your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7d2bba6d126942e406e663b0824bfae5.poster.avif?t=1753976991\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7d2bba6d126942e406e663b0824bfae5.webm?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/7d2bba6d126942e406e663b0824bfae5.mp4?t=1753976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/8a4061013a9c89d98ac3d24e6c0a0e33.avif?t=1753976991\" width=680 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>three romanceable love</strong> <strong>interests</strong> in the main story of the game - Vanille, Void, Zephyr</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/5a2733984c4412ca1aa3126e06f25056.avif?t=1753976991\" data-has-big width=800 height=509 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/6dafdfa8ea14a88477bb82906e927553.avif?t=1753976991\" data-has-big width=800 height=509 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474870/extras/17434ae2449aafac8b461fe552fc14a9.avif?t=1753976991\" data-has-big width=800 height=509 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
